{c: Verse 1}
[E]Sach Mere Yaar Hai,
[E]Bas Wohi Pyar Hai
[C#m]Jiske Badle Mein
[A]Koyi [F#m]Toh [B]Pyar De
[E]Baaki Bekaar Hai, Yaar Mere?
[E]Ho Yaar Mere
[E]Jis Haath Mein, [C#m]Ik Haath Hai..
[B]Uss Haath Ki, [E]Kya Baat Hai...
[E]Kya Faasle.. [C#m]Kya ManZilein..
[B]Ik Humsafar.. [E]Gar Saath Hai
[C#m]Jiski [A]Kismat Koyii [F#m]Yun [B]Sawaar De
[E]Woh Hi Dildaar Hai.. Yaar Mere
[E]Ho Yaar Mere
[E]Jhume Zameen... [C#m]Jhume Gagan
[B]Tere Liye.... [E]Hoke Magan
[E]Khiltee Rahe [C#m]Khushiyan Teri
[B]Mehka Rahe.. [E]Dil Kaa Chaman
[C#m]Zindagi [A]Tujhko [F#m]Aisi [B]Bahaar De
[E]Dil Ki Pukaar Hai, Yaar Mere?.
[E]Haan Yaar Mere
